abstract: >-
  Partial written proofs, precisely scoped limitations of proof mechanisms,
  exact arithmetic certificate checkers, finite evidence, and tests for the
  conjectured distinct-variable two-color Rado number of x+2y=kz for odd k>=11.
  The uniform upper bound remains open. Substantial OpenAI Codex assistance
  is disclosed; no formal verification, human peer review, or established
  novelty is claimed.
keywords:
  - Rado numbers
  - distinct variables
  - arithmetic Ramsey theory
  - reproducible research
  - certificates
